{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"Web holds up a hand to Lilia. \"Have to let her be angry. Grief is rage sometimes.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T20:53:02.885000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743572852220887061","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"\"I understand more then anyone what he was trying to do. He was trying to  unite everyone. The whole time he has been trying to bring everyone together to work as a team. But all he got was blame. He told web to get the law changed so he would have to do anything but no one listened. What do you think he would do right now if he were still here?:","created_at":"2020-08-13T20:55:40.329000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743573512588886067","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
