{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"He cries for the dead, but mostly he cries for the living.","created_at":"2020-08-18T15:51:21.817000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745308870167232653","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"\"Tisnt fair! None o it!\" He sobs. He thinks of all he has promised to protect. He imagines losing each of them. Horrible thoughts. Some past, some fears of the future. The hunger, ever encroaching. \"Just leave us alone! Go away! Aint fair!\" He sobs between breaths. Overcome with fears. He curls in a ball.","created_at":"2020-08-18T16:00:03.305000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745311057446436884","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
