{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"Leaf takes a slow walk to the oasis. It's been a while since she'd been here, and yet it was one of the first places on the island she felt welcome. Leaf sighs and kneels next to Lilly and Sandi. She says in elvish ||\"We've got three days now... A lot to do. I'm not quite sure where to start. It's all very overwhelming. But at the same time... I feel like I should be more scared than I am. Maybe I've just run out of energy to worry? I suppose that's a good thing, as long as I have energy for other things of course. Everything is happening so quickly and slowly at the same time-\"|| Leaf shakes her head. ||\"Enough about me. Wynne mentioned helping the plants here. I think that sounds like a lovely idea. One thing at a time. Help plants today, destroy the hunger on Friday.\"||","created_at":"2020-08-19T06:49:37.527000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-19T06:50:01.052000Z","id":"745534925159006250","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
